assets/playwright contains files derived from Playwright 1.64.1 (playwright-core) and modified:
the injected in-page script (wrapped in a factory function and minified), and the US keyboard
layout and the device descriptors (extracted to JSON; the descriptors keep only some fields). At
runtime hba also renames the few identifiers the injected script makes visible to pages.
